{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/125813-identity-theft-and-id-storage","id":125813,"title":"Identity Theft and ID Storage","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-05-05T08:07:34-07:00","id":125813,"title":"Identity Theft and ID Storage","content":"This came up in a game last night, after a player bought Identity Theft. The text of the power seems to indicate that the IDs you steal can be stored an reused later, so long as you are in Primum miles of the actual ID owner. The question is, is there any limit to how many ID you can store? On the one hand, no limit seems fine because of the range limitation, but if a player used the power a lot she could end up with literally hundreds of stolen IDs to call upon. That last possibility seems to be a great deal of utility for an embed.<br /> <br /> -Slag","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6-slagheap","name":"Slagheap","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"188"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-05T10:00:30-07:00","id":125909,"title":"","content":"One of my players picked this up, too. Lead to a few long discussions about the nature of the power. Basically, we fell on letting the power, in its base form, last a few days. The more you discover/uncover about your stolen identity, the longer it will be available to you. Similarly, while the power grants the user access to the target's social merits, but I was forced to say that it doesn't innately grant knowledge of those merits; that's where other Embeds, Exploits, Demonic Form powers, and plain old surveillance come in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2630-mayberry","name":"Mayberry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2630_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}